    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d86">

                <pb facs="0197" n="127" xml:id="pg127"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">763.72119/2927: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                            Acting Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">U. S. S. “George Washington,”</hi>
                        </placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1918-12-07T17:00:00-05:00">December 7,
                            1918—5 p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received December 8—12:58 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>4. Your 2, December 5, 12 noon. For Colonel
                        House. President suggests that arrangements for meeting of
                    Inter-Allied Conference be postponed until preliminary informal discussions have
                    shown just what would be best in all the circumstances.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
